  <meta name="description" content="Apex Auto Shop - magazin online pentru piese auto, tuning si accesorii, cu selectie dupa marca, model, an si motor.">
  <title>Apex Auto Shop - Piese auto si tuning</title>
</head>
<body id="top">
<%- include('../fragmente/header') %>

<main id="continut-principal">

  <!-- ZONA 1: Prezentare / Hero -->
  <div class="zona zona1">
    <aside aria-label="Anunt important">
      <p><mark>Oferta rapida:</mark> transport gratuit pentru comenzi peste 500 RON in limita stocului. <i class="fa-solid fa-gear fa-spin"></i></p>
    </aside>
    <section id="acasa">
      <hgroup>
        <h2>Magazin piese auto online pentru pasionati de performanta</h2>
        <p>Piese aftermarket, piese OEM si tuning auto Romania intr-un singur loc.</p>
      </hgroup>

      <p>
        La <b>Apex Auto Shop</b> gasesti <b>piese auto performanta</b>, <b>accesorii auto</b> si servicii
        pentru orice proiect de garaj tuning. Platforma noastra de <i>fitment check</i> te ajuta sa
        alegi rapid piesele compatibile cu masina ta.
      </p>

      <p id="selector-auto">
        Selectorul auto filtreaza rezultate dupa marca, model, an si motorizare.
        Astfel, in magazinul de piese auto online vezi doar produse relevante.
        Daca apare o campanie urgenta de stoc, mesajul principal este:
        <strong>stoc limitat pentru kiturile de evacuari sport</strong>.
      </p>

      <blockquote cite="https://www.fia.com/">
        "Performanta reala vine din compatibilitate corecta, nu doar din pret mic."
      </blockquote>

      <p>
        Pentru clientii noi explicam termenii tehnici: <abbr title="Original Equipment Manufacturer">OEM</abbr>
        si piese aftermarket. Un exemplu de termen util este
        <dfn id="coilover-def">coilover</dfn>, adica o suspensie reglabila pe inaltime si rigiditate.
        Daca un produs este retras, il marcam clar: <s>Kit Stage 1 vechi</s> <ins>Kit Stage 1 revizuit 2026</ins>.
        Noi spunem uneori, in gluma, ca masina "merge <em>perfect</em>" dupa primul upgrade.
      </p>

      <section id="categorie">
        <h3>Categorie principale din catalog piese auto</h3>
        <dl>
          <dt>Piese Auto pentru mentenanta</dt>
          <dd>Motor, frane, suspensie, directie, filtre, sisteme electrice.</dd>
          <dt>Tuning si Performanta</dt>
          <dd>Evacuari sport, filtre aer sport, suspensii reglabile, electronica.</dd>
          <dt>Exterior si Interior</dt>
          <dd>Jante aliaj, anvelope, elemente de styling, accesorii cockpit.</dd>
        </dl>

        <article id="magazin">
          <h4>Magazin - recomandari rapide</h4>
          <p>
            Vezi oferte pentru evacuari sport, jante aliaj si suspensii reglabile.
            Catalogul include producator, pret, stoc si compatibilitate.
          </p>

          <figure>
            <picture>
              <source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="/resurse/imagini/garage-small.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
              <source media="(max-width: 1024px)" srcset="/resurse/imagini/garage-medium.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
              <img src="/resurse/imagini/garage-large.svg" alt="Garaj Apex Auto Shop cu piese pregatite pentru montaj" title="Zona de pregatire comenzi Apex Auto Shop" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy">
            </picture>
            <figcaption>Zona de pregatire comenzi pentru piese auto performanta si accesorii auto.</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </article>
      </section>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- ZONA 2: Tabel oferte -->
  <div class="zona zona2">
    <section id="tabel-oferte">
      <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-tags"></i> Tabel oferte saptamanale</h2>
      <div class="tabel-wrapper">
        <table>
          <caption>Top produse pentru tuning auto Romania - martie 2026</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Produs</th>
              <th scope="col">Categorie</th>
              <th scope="col">Pret (RON)</th>
              <th scope="col">Stoc</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td rowspan="2">Kit admisie Apex AirFlow</td>
              <td>Filtre aer sport</td>
              <td>890</td>
              <td>24 buc</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Montaj inclus in service partener</td>
              <td>0</td>
              <td>programare online</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Evacuare sport Street Pro</td>
              <td>Evacuari sport</td>
              <td>1750</td>
              <td>11 buc</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Coilover Track Balance</td>
              <td>Suspensii reglabile</td>
              <td>3290</td>
              <td>7 buc</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Set jante aliaj 18 inch</td>
              <td>Exterior si Interior</td>
              <td>2450</td>
              <td>9 seturi</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
          <tfoot>
            <tr>
              <td colspan="4">Preturile includ TVA. Verifica compatibilitatea in selectorul auto inainte de comanda.</td>
            </tr>
          </tfoot>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- ZONA 8: Continut liber / creativ -->
  <div class="zona zona8">
    <section id="blog">
      <h2>Blog tehnic</h2>
      <p>
        In blog publicam ghiduri pentru montaj evacuare, alegerea uleiului si comparatii intre setup-uri.
        Recomandam articolul extern despre baze de tuning:
        <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Automotive_tuning" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Introducere in automotive tuning</a>.
      </p>

      <p>
        Link catre o referinta externa cu identificator:
        <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Automotive_tuning#Engine_tuning" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          https://en.<wbr>wikipedia.<wbr>org/wiki/<wbr>Automotive_<wbr>tuning#Engine_<wbr>tuning
        </a>
      </p>

      <p>
        Citat recomandat din <cite>High-Performance Automotive Handbook</cite>:
        <q>Masoara de doua ori compatibilitatea si monteaza o singura data.</q>
      </p>

      <p>
        Imagine marita la click:
        <a href="/resurse/imagini/garage-large.svg">
          <img src="/resurse/imagini/garage-small.svg" alt="Preview imagine garaj" width="180" height="101" loading="lazy">
        </a>
      </p>

      <p>
        Descarca ghidul introductiv:
        <a href="/resurse/descarcari/ghid-apex-auto-shop.txt" download="ghid-apex-auto-shop-descarcat.txt">Download ghid setup</a>
      </p>

      <section>
        <h3>Formula putere la roata</h3>
        <p>In tuning, puterea efectiva la roata se calculeaza tinand cont de pierderile din transmisie:</p>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
          <mrow>
            <msub>
              <mi>P</mi>
              <mtext>roata</mtext>
            </msub>
            <mo>=</mo>
            <mfrac>
              <mrow>
                <msub>
                  <mi>T</mi>
                  <mtext>motor</mtext>
                </msub>
                <mo>&#xD7;</mo>
                <mi>n</mi>
              </mrow>
              <mn>5252</mn>
            </mfrac>
            <mo>&#xD7;</mo>
            <msub>
              <mi>&#x3B7;</mi>
              <mtext>transmisie</mtext>
            </msub>
          </mrow>
        </math>
        <p>
          Unde <i>T<sub>motor</sub></i> este cuplul motorului in lb&#xB7;ft,
          <i>n</i> este turatia in RPM, iar &#x3B7;<sub>transmisie</sub>
          este randamentul transmisiei (de obicei 0.85&#x2013;0.90 pentru tractiune fata).
        </p>
        <p>Conversia in kilowati:</p>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
          <mrow>
            <mi>P</mi>
            <mo>[</mo>
            <mtext>kW</mtext>
            <mo>]</mo>
            <mo>=</mo>
            <msub>
              <mi>P</mi>
              <mtext>roata</mtext>
            </msub>
            <mo>&#xD7;</mo>
            <mn>0.7457</mn>
          </mrow>
        </math>
      </section>
    </section>

    <!-- Video recomandate cu taburi iframe -->
    <section id="video">
      <h2>Video recomandate pentru montaj</h2>
      <div class="container-iframe">
        <div class="taburi-iframe">
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/qgWXFyutOYE?si=6dRcqlHJwwG7aTJi" target="ifr-video">Video curent</a>
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZaIsQSe5z9Q?si=JpaeWHWbz0ITPv4g" target="ifr-video">Schimb filtre aer sport</a>
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/_k0Gjre1QlY?si=hrFhcwNVY7FyLay0" target="ifr-video">Suspensii</a>
        </div>
        <iframe
          name="ifr-video"
          width="560"
          height="315"
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/qgWXFyutOYE?si=6dRcqlHJwwG7aTJi"
          loading="lazy"
          title="Videoclip YouTube montaj"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
          referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
          allowfullscreen>
        </iframe>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Video HTML5 cu subtitrari VTT (Etapa 4 - video-vtt) -->
    <section id="video-vtt">
      <h2>Test dinamometru - video demonstrativ</h2>
      <p>Vizualizeaza un test de performanta pe dinamometru. Activeaza subtitrarea in limba dorita:</p>
      <video controls preload="auto"
             poster="/resurse/imagini/poster-dyno.jpg"
             class="video-vtt">
        <source src="/resurse/video/dyno-test.webm" type="video/webm">
        <source src="/resurse/video/dyno-test.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        <track src="/resurse/vtt/car-ro.vtt" kind="subtitles" srclang="ro" label="Romana" default>
        <track src="/resurse/vtt/car-en.vtt" kind="subtitles" srclang="en" label="English">
        Browserul tau nu suporta elementul video.
      </video>
    </section>

    <section id="playlist-video">
      <h2>Playlist auto - tutoriale montaj</h2>
      <p>Videoclipurile de mai jos ruleaza automat unul dupa altul si se reiau de la inceput dupa ultimul:</p>
      <iframe
        width="560"
        height="315"
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?si=kbHzOISt3N_XwDPI&amp;list=PL90l5Xy1aUS4-o494iRltqHevvmYT3Xcg"
        title="Playlist tutoriale montaj piese auto"
        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
        referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        loading="lazy"
        allowfullscreen>
      </iframe>
    </section>

    <section id="catalog-pdf">
      <h2>Catalog PDF</h2>
      <p>Consultati catalogul nostru de produse direct in pagina:</p>
      <object data="/resurse/descarcari/catalog-piese-auto.pdf" type="application/pdf" width="1000" height="500">
        <p>Browserul nu suporta afisarea PDF-ului. <a href="/resurse/descarcari/catalog-piese-auto.pdf">Descarca catalogul PDF</a>.</p>
      </object>
    </section>

    <section id="harta-interactiva">
      <h2>Harta interactiva a garajului</h2>
      <p>Apasa pe diferitele zone ale garajului pentru a naviga rapid catre sectiunile site-ului:</p>
      <img src="/resurse/imagini/garage-large.svg"
           alt="Harta interactiva garaj Apex Auto Shop"
           title="Click pe zone pentru navigare rapida"
